  m_text: "Game Director,\nProgrammer and Game Designer\n\nWan Mustafa Irfan bin\n
    Mohamed Shukri\n\n\nArt Director\n\nArina Farisa\n\n\nProject Manager\n\nPhang
    May Chih\n\n\nSocial Media Manager\n& Graphic Designer\n\nEliora Kusmawardi\n\n\nArtists\n\nArina
    Farisa\n\nEliora Kusmawardi\n\nPhang May Chih\n\n\nMusic Composer \n\nYong Huey
    Yee\n\nSound Designer\n\nYong Huey Yee\n\nWan Mustafa Irfan bin\nMohamed Shukri\n\n\nReferences
    Used:\nRaycastly\nBrackeys\nSasquatch B Studios\nShaped By Rain Studios\niHeartGameDev\n\n\nSpecial
    Thanks!\n\nTommy Wong\nAndy Chaisiri\nYung Sing Lim\nJoanne Poon\nRaven Cheong
    Kai Jiat\nKhor Kai Jie\nGloria Teoh \nDamien Teng \nAll my friends from KnockOut,
    Unveil and The One Academy\nMy friends and family\n\n\nAnd To You,\nPlayer\nTHANK
    YOU FOR PLAYING\n\n"
